<title>SOUTH KOREA: Seyang Shipping mulls court receivership.</title>
<headline>Seyang Shipping mulls court receivership.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Seyang Shipping Co Ltd said on Wednesday it was considering seeking court receivership or looking for a buyer as it faced financial trouble.</p>
<p>A Seyang statement said financial institutions started avoiding deals with the company because its largest shareholder had links to the debt-stricken Hanbo Group.</p>
</text>
